WEBVTT

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:28.506
[BLOWING]

00:00:56.317 --> 00:01:01.191
GIRL: With every sun
comes a new day.
A new beginning.
每一次日出都带来新的一天

00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:04.673
A hope that things
will be better today
than they were yesterday.
彷佛今天的一切都会比昨天好

00:01:05.935 --> 00:01:08.633
But not for me.
My name is Eep.
但我不这么想 我是一妹

00:01:08.677 --> 00:01:11.941
And this is my family,
the Croods.
这是我的家人:古鲁家族

00:01:11.984 --> 00:01:14.248
If you weren't clued in
already by the animal skins
从我们身上的兽皮和倾斜的前额

00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:16.772
and sloping foreheads,
we're cavemen.
就能知道我们是原始人

00:01:16.815 --> 00:01:18.078
[ANIMAL GROWLS][GASPS]
大部分时候

00:01:18.121 --> 00:01:22.473
Most days we spend
in our cave, in the dark.
大部分时候

00:01:22.517 --> 00:01:27.130
Night after night,
day after day.
日复一日 一成不变

00:01:27.174 --> 00:01:31.395
Yep, home sweet home.
没错 这就是我甜美的家

00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:33.267
When we did go out,
we struggled
to find food
我们离开洞穴唯一的原因

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:36.270
in a harsh
and hostile world.
[GROWLING]
就是在恶劣的环境中找寻食物

00:01:36.313 --> 00:01:37.575
[HISSING]
我还得忍受我的家人

00:01:37.619 --> 00:01:40.839
And I struggled
to survive my family.
我还得忍受我的家人

00:01:40.883 --> 00:01:42.450
[ALL SCREAMING]
我们是硕果仅存的人类了

00:01:42.493 --> 00:01:45.322
We were the last ones around.
There used to be neighbors.
以前曾有过邻居

00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:46.454
Uh, the Gorts,
戈兹家族 被长毛象踩扁了

00:01:46.497 --> 00:01:48.195
smashed by a mammoth.
[ALL GASP]
戈兹家族 被长毛象踩扁了

00:01:48.238 --> 00:01:51.285
The Horks,
swallowed by a sand snake.
霍克家族 被沙蛇给吞了

00:01:51.328 --> 00:01:53.722
The Erfs, mosquito bite.
尔夫家族 被蚊子咬到

00:01:53.765 --> 00:01:57.552
Throgs, common cold.
[SNEEZES]
索格家族 得了感冒

00:01:57.595 --> 00:02:00.468
And the Croods, that's us.
[GROWLS]
古鲁家族 就是我们

00:02:00.511 --> 00:02:04.298
The Croods made it,
because of my dad.
[GRUNTS]
能存活下来是因为我爸

00:02:04.341 --> 00:02:08.084
He was strong,
and he followed the rules.
他很强壮 而且一切都照规定来

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.999
The ones painted
on the cave walls.
就是洞穴墙上的那些规定

00:02:10.042 --> 00:02:12.741
[GASPS]
Anything new is bad,
curiosity is bad.
新东西都不好 好奇心不好

00:02:12.784 --> 00:02:17.180
Going out at night is bad.
Basically,
anything fun is bad.
基本上 只要是有趣的事都不好

00:02:17.224 --> 00:02:19.313
Welcome to my world.
欢迎来到我的世界

00:02:19.356 --> 00:02:24.927
But this is a story
about how all that
changed in an instant.
这一切如何在一夕之间改变

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.235
Because what we didn't know
was that our world...
因为我们不知道我们的世界...

00:02:28.278 --> 00:02:30.933
was about to come to an end.
即将步向末日

00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:36.199
And there were no rules
on our cave walls to
prepare us for that.
而在我们洞穴墙上的规定

00:02:37.548 --> 00:02:38.854
[GRUNTS]

00:02:38.897 --> 00:02:40.464
[PANTING]
[YELLING]

00:02:46.078 --> 00:02:47.297
[YELLING CONTINUES]

00:02:47.341 --> 00:02:48.516
[BONES CRACKS]
[GROANS]

00:02:48.559 --> 00:02:49.821
[PANTING]

00:02:52.563 --> 00:02:53.956
[ROARS]
[WHIMPERS]

00:02:54.435 --> 00:02:55.914
[ROARS]
你应该要等我信号的 一妹

00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:59.353
GRUG: You are
supposed to wait
for my signal. Eep?
你应该要等我信号的 一妹

00:03:02.138 --> 00:03:03.574
Boo.
[ALL YELPING]
吓

00:03:03.618 --> 00:03:04.662
Ah!
啊 不要

00:03:04.706 --> 00:03:06.969
Ow! No!
[GROANING]
啊 不要

00:03:07.448 --> 00:03:08.623
[GRUNTS]

00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:11.278
[SIGHS]
我们已经在洞穴里待了一辈子了

00:03:11.321 --> 00:03:14.455
Oh, we've been in
that cave forever.
我们已经在洞穴里待了一辈子了

00:03:14.498 --> 00:03:16.979
GRUG: Three days
is not forever.
三天不是一辈子

00:03:17.022 --> 00:03:18.546
It is with this family.
在我们家就像度日如年

00:03:18.589 --> 00:03:20.635
Eep,
would you come down here?
一妹 你下来好吗 你太夸张了

00:03:20.678 --> 00:03:23.072
You're being so dramatic.
一妹 你下来好吗 你太夸张了

00:03:23.115 --> 00:03:24.378
[GROWLS]
不 珊蒂 回来

00:03:24.421 --> 00:03:27.032
GRUG: No, Sandy,
come back here.
[PANTING]
不 珊蒂 回来

00:03:27.076 --> 00:03:31.036
Remember the signal.
Good girls wait
for the signal. Ugga.
好女孩会等信号 娥姐

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.778
As soon as I get Sandy,
I'll go back in, and
you can give the signal.
到时候你就能发出信号

00:03:33.822 --> 00:03:35.606
No, I mean,
you're already out now.
算了 你都已经出来了

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.478
THUNK: I'm waiting
for the signal, Dad.
我在等信号 老爸

00:03:37.521 --> 00:03:39.784
Never mind, Thunk.
Just come out.
算了 坦克 出来吧

00:03:39.828 --> 00:03:41.960
THUNK: But if you don't
give the signal,
可是你没有发信号

00:03:42.004 --> 00:03:43.614
how do I know
you're my dad?
我怎么知道你是我爸

00:03:43.658 --> 00:03:45.486
The signal isn't
so you know it's me.
信号不是让你确定我是你爸

00:03:45.529 --> 00:03:48.445
It's so you know
I wasn't eaten
by an animal.
是让你知道我没有被动物吃掉

00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:50.578
THUNK: Then why is the signal
an animal noise?
那信号为什么是动物叫声

00:03:50.621 --> 00:03:52.710
Doesn't that
just confuse things?
这样不是让人分不清楚吗

00:03:52.754 --> 00:03:55.974
[EXHALES] Oh!
I don't know. I'm still
waiting for the signal.
我不确定安不安全 我还在等信号

00:03:56.801 --> 00:03:59.369
Hoo-hoo! Hoo-hoo!

00:04:02.329 --> 00:04:03.678
[YELLING]

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.812
[BABBLING]

00:04:09.466 --> 00:04:10.815
[CONTINUES YELLING]

00:04:12.382 --> 00:04:13.383
[GRUNTS]

00:04:14.558 --> 00:04:17.474
UGGA: Mom,
we're ready to leave.
妈 我们准备走了

00:04:18.388 --> 00:04:19.824
Mom?
妈

00:04:20.651 --> 00:04:21.870
[GASPS]

00:04:21.913 --> 00:04:24.394
Still alive.
[SIGHS]
我还活着

00:04:24.438 --> 00:04:25.961
[CHUCKLES]
It's still early.
祸害要死还早

00:04:26.004 --> 00:04:28.790
And you're still fat.
[GROANS]
你要变瘦也还早

00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:32.272
Breakfast formation!
[GASPS]
早餐队形

00:04:32.315 --> 00:04:34.448
I want to see
some real caveman
action out there.
等一下给我表现得像真正的原始人

00:04:34.491 --> 00:04:35.753
We do this fast.
我们动作迅速

00:04:35.797 --> 00:04:38.452
We do this loud.
We do this as a family.
我们大呼小叫 我们全家出动

00:04:39.844 --> 00:04:42.325
And never not be afraid!
绝对记得要害怕

00:04:42.369 --> 00:04:43.718
[ALL YELLING]
古鲁家族

00:05:00.778 --> 00:05:02.824
Yay, breakfast.
[ALL PANTING]
冲啊 吃早餐

00:05:08.525 --> 00:05:09.874
[WARBLES]

00:05:13.051 --> 00:05:14.052
[SQUAWKS]

00:05:15.227 --> 00:05:16.577
[SHRIEKS]

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.752
[ALL WHIMPERING]

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.668
Who's up?
轮到谁

00:05:20.711 --> 00:05:23.148
We'll flip for it.
Call her in the air.
我们丢老妈来决定 快选边

00:05:23.192 --> 00:05:25.803
[SCREAMS]Heads!
头

00:05:25.847 --> 00:05:27.370
Tails. Thunk is in.
[GROANS]
是屁股 坦克上吧 就定位

00:05:27.414 --> 00:05:29.111
Positions.
[GRUNTS]
是屁股 坦克上吧 就定位

00:05:29.154 --> 00:05:31.374
Okay. Thunk--
好了 坦克

00:05:31.418 --> 00:05:32.810
Go.
去吧

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.509
[GASPS]
Come on, Thunk.
加油啊 坦克

00:05:39.556 --> 00:05:40.731
[CHUCKLES]

00:05:41.863 --> 00:05:43.952
Ha! Way to go.
Take it to the cave.
做得好 把它带回洞穴

00:05:43.995 --> 00:05:45.345
[SCREAMS]

00:05:45.388 --> 00:05:47.216
[GROANS]
Ohh!

00:05:48.739 --> 00:05:50.872
Release the baby!
放小孩

00:05:50.915 --> 00:05:52.569
[GROWLING]
Get them, Sandy! Go!
快去追 珊蒂 上

